<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106916" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάντ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>coming to meet,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξῆλθον εἰς ὑπάντησιν αὐτῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Jo.</u>
					12.13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				11.8.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				4.6
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψήφισμα -ήσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					798.16
				</span></i>
			 (Cyzicus, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astrol., <i>encounter</i> of a heavenly
			body, in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφεσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				132
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			metaph., <i>retort, answer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				11.202
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.278
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				305.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>counter-treatment,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.41
			</span></i>.</div>
